definition shares (Automatic for a new family).", "Usage"], 
  Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], Cell["Option of ModularFormDefinition: the \
family whose relative-normalization unknowns the definition shares (parameter \
IDs are FamilyID <> \":\" <> label).", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Automatic (default: a new family) or a string. Other values fail with \
